# SwasthyaMitra — UML Diagrams for Chapter 3

All diagrams are based on the **latest master branch** codebase.

**Color Legend (3 colors):**
- 🔵 **Blue** — Core UI & Activities
- 🟡 **Yellow** — AI / Computation / Logic
- 🟣 **Lavender** — Data models & Storage

---

## 3.1 Use Case Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    User(("<b>User</b>"))

    subgraph A["<b>Authentication & Onboarding</b>"]
        UC1["<b>Sign Up</b>"]
        UC2["<b>Sign In</b>"]
        UC3["<b>Forgot Password</b>"]
        UC4["<b>Enter Personal Data</b>"]
        UC5["<b>Set Fitness Goals</b>"]
        UC6["<b>Set Lifestyle Preferences</b>"]
    end

    subgraph B["<b>Food & Nutrition</b>"]
        UC7["<b>Log Food Manually</b>"]
        UC8["<b>Search Indian Food DB</b>"]
        UC9["<b>Scan Barcode</b>"]
        UC10["<b>View Nutrition Summary</b>"]
        UC11["<b>Generate AI Diet Plan</b>"]
        UC12["<b>Regenerate / Skip Meal</b>"]
    end

    subgraph C["<b>Exercise & Fitness</b>"]
        UC13["<b>AI Exercise Recommendation</b>"]
        UC14["<b>Log Manual Exercise</b>"]
        UC15["<b>View Exercise History</b>"]
        UC16["<b>Workout Dashboard</b>"]
    end

    subgraph D["<b>Activity Tracking</b>"]
        UC17["<b>Start Step Tracking</b>"]
        UC18["<b>Step Session History</b>"]
        UC19["<b>Track Sleep</b>"]
        UC20["<b>Track Hydration</b>"]
        UC21["<b>View Map & Route</b>"]
    end

    subgraph E["<b>Wellness & AI</b>"]
        UC22["<b>Log Mood</b>"]
        UC23["<b>Mood Recommendations</b>"]
        UC24["<b>AI Coach Message</b>"]
        UC25["<b>Enable Period Mode</b>"]
    end

    subgraph F["<b>Gamification</b>"]
        UC26["<b>Streaks & Shields</b>"]
        UC27["<b>Earn XP & Level Up</b>"]
        UC28["<b>View Badges</b>"]
        UC29["<b>Create / Join Challenge</b>"]
    end

    subgraph G["<b>Smart Pantry</b>"]
        UC30["<b>Photograph Ingredients</b>"]
        UC31["<b>Get AI Recipe</b>"]
    end

    subgraph H["<b>Safety & Emergency</b>"]
        UC32["<b>Manage Emergency Contacts</b>"]
        UC33["<b>Send SOS Alert</b>"]
        UC34["<b>Enable Ghost Mode</b>"]
    end

    subgraph I["<b>Reports & Profile</b>"]
        UC35["<b>Progress Dashboard</b>"]
        UC36["<b>Detailed Report</b>"]
        UC37["<b>View / Edit Profile</b>"]
        UC38["<b>Customise Avatar</b>"]
        UC39["<b>Weight Progress</b>"]
        UC40["<b>Insights & Micro-Goals</b>"]
    end

    User --- A
    User --- B
    User --- C
    User --- D
    User --- E
    User --- F
    User --- G
    User --- H
    User --- I

    UC9 -.->|extends| UC7
    UC8 -.->|extends| UC7
    UC11 -.->|includes| UC10
    UC23 -.->|includes| UC22

    style User fill:#1565C0,stroke:#0D47A1,color:#fff,font-weight:bold
    style A fill:#D6EAF8,stroke:#1565C0,color:#0D47A1
    style B fill:#FEF9E7,stroke:#F39C12,color:#7D6608
    style C fill:#FEF9E7,stroke:#F39C12,color:#7D6608
    style D fill:#D6EAF8,stroke:#1565C0,color:#0D47A1
    style E fill:#E8DAEF,stroke:#7D3C98,color:#4A235A
    style F fill:#D6EAF8,stroke:#1565C0,color:#0D47A1
    style G fill:#FEF9E7,stroke:#F39C12,color:#7D6608
    style H fill:#E8DAEF,stroke:#7D3C98,color:#4A235A
    style I fill:#D6EAF8,stroke:#1565C0,color:#0D47A1
```

