## 3.4 Flowcharts

### 3.4.1 App Launch, Auth & Navigation

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([App Launch]):::blue --> B{Logged In?}:::lavender
    B -- No --> C[Login / Sign Up]:::blue
    C --> D{New User?}:::lavender
    D -- Yes --> E[Sign Up]:::blue --> F[Personal Data & Goals]:::yellow --> HP
    D -- No --> J[Sign In]:::blue --> B2{Auth OK?}:::lavender
    B2 -- No --> C
    B2 -- Yes --> K{Onboarded?}:::lavender
    B -- Yes --> K
    K -- No --> F
    K -- Yes --> HP[Homepage]:::blue

    HP --> M[Food Log]:::yellow
    HP --> N[Exercise]:::yellow
    HP --> O[Steps]:::blue
    HP --> P[AI Diet]:::yellow
    HP --> Q[Hydration]:::blue
    HP --> R[Sleep]:::blue
    HP --> S[Mood]:::lavender
    HP --> T[Gamification]:::blue
    HP --> U[Safety/SOS]:::lavender
    HP --> V[Reports]:::blue
    HP --> W[Pantry]:::yellow
    HP --> X[Profile]:::blue

    classDef blue fill:#D6EAF8,stroke:#1565C0,color:#0D47A1,font-weight:bold
    classDef yellow fill:#FEF9E7,stroke:#F39C12,color:#7D6608,font-weight:bold
    classDef lavender fill:#E8DAEF,stroke:#7D3C98,color:#4A235A,font-weight:bold
```

### 3.4.2 Food Logging & AI Diet Plan Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    M[Food Log]:::blue --> M1{Entry Method?}:::lavender
    M1 --> M2[Search DB]:::blue
    M1 --> M3[Manual]:::blue
    M1 --> M4[Barcode]:::blue
    M2 & M3 & M4 --> M5[Save to Firestore]:::lavender --> M6[Update Nutrition]:::yellow --> HP[Homepage]:::blue

    P[AI Diet Plan]:::yellow --> P1[Fetch Profile & Calc TDEE]:::yellow
    P1 --> P2[Context: Plateau / Season / Period]:::yellow --> P3[Build Prompt]:::yellow
    P3 --> P4{Gemini OK?}:::lavender
    P4 -- Yes --> P5[Generate & Validate Plan]:::yellow --> P6[Display Plan]:::blue --> HP
    P4 -- No --> P7[Fallback Plan]:::blue --> HP

    classDef blue fill:#D6EAF8,stroke:#1565C0,color:#0D47A1,font-weight:bold
    classDef yellow fill:#FEF9E7,stroke:#F39C12,color:#7D6608,font-weight:bold
    classDef lavender fill:#E8DAEF,stroke:#7D3C98,color:#4A235A,font-weight:bold
```

### 3.4.3 Step Tracking & SOS Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    O[Step Tracking]:::blue --> O1[Sensor + GPS Data]:::blue
    O1 --> O2[5-Layer Validation]:::yellow
    O2 --> O3[Validated Steps]:::blue --> O4[Sync Firebase]:::lavender --> HP[Homepage]:::blue

    U[Safety & SOS]:::lavender --> U1{Action?}:::lavender
    U1 --> U2[Manage Contacts]:::blue --> HP
    U1 --> U3[Trigger SOS]:::yellow --> U4[GPS + SMS]:::yellow --> U5[Log to Firebase]:::lavender --> HP

    classDef blue fill:#D6EAF8,stroke:#1565C0,color:#0D47A1,font-weight:bold
    classDef yellow fill:#FEF9E7,stroke:#F39C12,color:#7D6608,font-weight:bold
    classDef lavender fill:#E8DAEF,stroke:#7D3C98,color:#4A235A,font-weight:bold
```
